01:05:16,040 --> 01:05:17,040
All right.

90
01:05:17,040 --> 01:05:18,040
Well, did he get hired?

91
01:05:18,040 --> 01:05:19,040
Yes, he did.

92
01:05:19,040 --> 01:05:20,040
All right.

93
01:05:20,040 --> 01:05:23,560
