01:08:04,520 --> 01:08:05,520
to sell that one.

146
01:08:05,520 --> 01:08:09,240
No, you get choices that are really similar when you get those reversals.

147
01:08:09,240 --> 01:08:12,840
So it isn't showing that you can go and manipulate people a lot.

148
01:08:12,840 --> 01:08:16,520
It's showing you can manipulate them a little bit.

149
01:08:16,520 --> 01:08:21,040
So obviously, if you're trying to get people to play Russian roulette, which you shouldn't

