01:08:24,960 --> 01:08:27,040
So why not, man?

152
01:08:27,040 --> 01:08:30,160
So that's not very convincing.

153
01:08:30,160 --> 01:08:34,520
And in general, even though it is a standard sales trick to go and try to frame everything

