01:32:57,080 --> 01:32:58,480
It's got seven features, right?

341
01:32:58,480 --> 01:32:59,600
Seven, was it nine?

342
01:32:59,600 --> 01:33:01,800
What are the standardized features of a Big Mac?

343
01:33:01,800 --> 01:33:03,840
Two all-beef patties, special sauce,

344
01:33:03,840 --> 01:33:05,400
lettuce, cheese, pickles, onions,

345
01:33:05,400 --> 01:33:06,800
on a sesame seed bun.

346
01:33:06,800 --> 01:33:07,920
All right, that one.

347
01:33:07,920 --> 01:33:09,960
Now, do you think that they just throw dice

348
01:33:09,960 --> 01:33:11,880
to come up with that combination?

349
01:33:11,880 --> 01:33:13,600
They probably did a lot of market research

350
01:33:13,600 --> 01:33:16,200
to find out what most people like,

351
01:33:16,200 --> 01:33:18,280
and that's why they make it the standard option,

352
01:33:18,280 --> 01:33:19,440
because you don't want to pick

353
01:33:19,440 --> 01:33:21,160
a really weird standard option,

354
01:33:21,160 --> 01:33:22,880
which would then require that you're constantly

355
01:33:22,880 --> 01:33:25,080
going and adjusting the order.

356
01:33:25,080 --> 01:33:26,360
Instead, you want to get an option

357
01:33:26,360 --> 01:33:28,040
that has very broad appeal,

358
01:33:28,040 --> 01:33:30,160
and then you only have to adjust it for someone,

359
01:33:30,160 --> 01:33:31,320
well, this guy doesn't like pickles.

360
01:33:31,320 --> 01:33:32,680
There's weird people who don't like pickles.

361
01:33:32,680 --> 01:33:33,800
All right, fine, we'll go and adjust it.

362
01:33:33,800 --> 01:33:36,040
But you want to go and pick a standard option

363
01:33:36,040 --> 01:33:37,520
that's popular normally.

364
01:33:37,520 --> 01:33:40,920
So usually the status quo becomes the status quo

365
01:33:40,920 --> 01:33:42,960
by a process of market research,

366
01:33:42,960 --> 01:33:45,800
so a lot of people would genuinely and sincerely like it,

367
01:33:45,800 --> 01:33:50,080
and therefore, the effect is not nearly as big

368
01:33:50,080 --> 01:33:52,280
as it might seem on the surface.

369
01:33:52,280 --> 01:33:55,240
Okay, all right.

370
01:33:55,240 --> 01:33:57,960
So, and let's see, I was thinking of something else

