01:34:24,760 --> 01:34:27,480
So instead, you get jobs that are really close to each other,

386
01:34:27,480 --> 01:34:28,640
or like I don't think this has ever been

387
01:34:28,640 --> 01:34:31,520
an experiment with jobs, but that is the idea.

388
01:34:31,520 --> 01:34:34,360
So yeah, it's true that kids, for example,

