01:34:36,280 --> 01:34:39,040
that are ones that their parents had, right?

391
01:34:39,040 --> 01:34:42,360
But again, this is the case where it's like,

392
01:34:42,360 --> 01:34:45,160
well, it's within a broad social class

393
01:34:45,160 --> 01:34:47,160
where this is a job, this is a kind of general job

394
01:34:47,160 --> 01:34:49,160
that people like me would ordinarily get,

395
01:34:49,160 --> 01:34:50,920
but if you're Einstein and you're a dad to a janitor,

396
01:34:50,920 --> 01:34:52,760
then you're not very likely to become a janitor

397
01:34:52,760 --> 01:34:54,040
in that case, that's one like,

398
01:34:54,040 --> 01:34:55,160
oh, that doesn't seem very good,

399
01:34:55,160 --> 01:34:57,560
whereas if you're Einstein and your dad's an economist,

400
01:34:57,560 --> 01:35:00,360
then you might get into economics at an early age,

