01:35:04,400 --> 01:35:05,880
that are also very appealing,

404
01:35:05,880 --> 01:35:09,360
which would use those talents, right?

405
01:35:09,360 --> 01:35:12,040
Similarly, if someone gave you 100 coffee cups,

