01:35:33,800 --> 01:35:35,560
usually are also collectors,

417
01:35:35,560 --> 01:35:37,760
but nevertheless, they seem to be very good

418
01:35:37,760 --> 01:35:40,800
at distinguishing between objective market value

419
01:35:40,800 --> 01:35:44,280
and value to them, and they do not readily fall prey

420
01:35:44,280 --> 01:35:46,200
to this endowment effect.

421
01:35:46,200 --> 01:35:47,680
And again, the whole point of this was,

