01:35:47,680 --> 01:35:49,720
these are people in the real world.

423
01:35:49,720 --> 01:35:51,120
These are people who actually buy

424
01:35:51,120 --> 01:35:53,440
and sell baseball cards for a living,

425
01:35:53,440 --> 01:35:56,200
and it seems like that process actually goes

426
01:35:56,200 --> 01:35:58,680
and weaves the endowment effect out of them.

