01:37:06,960 --> 01:37:09,200
like an observation that's likely to be true,

457
01:37:09,200 --> 01:37:10,880
that they've done it so much

458
01:37:10,880 --> 01:37:12,600
that all of the allure of the game is gone,

459
01:37:12,600 --> 01:37:15,800
the magic has gone out, and it's no fun anymore.

460
01:37:15,800 --> 01:37:17,080
But maybe I'm wrong.

461
01:37:18,760 --> 01:37:22,480
All right, so, let's see here.

