01:38:13,600 --> 01:38:17,000
Presumably because, yes, they make more money

485
01:38:17,000 --> 01:38:19,400
if they don't put the salad at the front.

486
01:38:19,400 --> 01:38:21,840
So when he talks about, look, there's a free lunch

